      "body": "### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in 4.8.dev [[d7c45b1](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118813)] since commit [[da561cd](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/da561cd619711453c00a6d2eabe6048f76f62daa)]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (b3bb43a10) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1062) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhile using modern theme and low values of base_spacing, the action_map_editor, localization_editor and globals_editors (autoload/shader/groups) have part of their contents outside the window, or overlapping the bottom margin.\n\nbase_spacing=0:\n<img width=\"1144\" height=\"189\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ae4b48b-b23b-471c-bb93-ec3a4840cb98\" />\n<img width=\"1149\" height=\"195\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a4d4b0e-4b9c-4122-9cd0-62ab1df6342e\" />\nbase_spacing=1:\n<img width=\"1141\" height=\"206\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57fe2d3e-6f4e-4a33-baaf-c877176dc820\" />\n<img width=\"1145\" height=\"210\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e9d45ac-f2e3-4065-9cba-c36209cb2598\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn any project, after setting the editor theme style as modern and base_spacing=0, open the project settings and check the input map, localization editor or globals menu (while having at least one entry in them).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A",
